        <briefdescription>
<para>Appends a value to a text, in the plain mode of the formatter. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The text is moved into a local formatter, the value is appended, and the text is moved back, so that no other buffer is allocated.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the value, which must satisfy <computeroutput><ref refid="conceptmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1extension_1_1printable" kindref="compound">extension::printable</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>text</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The text to which the value is appended. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>value</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The value to append. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Returns</title><para>Nothing.</para>
</simplesect>
The text is moved into a formatter in the plain mode, the value is appended with the same <computeroutput>operator&lt;&lt;</computeroutput> overloads as the messages, and the text is moved back. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
