    <briefdescription>
<para>Writes values as text, as the messages of the checks are written. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Gives access to the plain mode of the <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1expression__formatter" kindref="compound">expression_formatter</ref></computeroutput>, which is private, so that the names of the test cases generated by <computeroutput>test_each()</computeroutput> show their values as the messages do: the numbers without the type suffixes, and the characters unquoted. </para>
